{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF8mBbumW6Vm2ieQnAX7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"prompt\": \"A square abstract painting filling the entire image edge to edge, with no frame, wall, room, or gallery setting. Purely nonrepresentational: no recognizable objects, figures, faces, bodies, scenes, landscapes, horizons, machines, diagrams, symbols, icons, letters, numbers, or text. Composition: a dense, dark indigo field at the lower half, layered with slow, deliberate horizontal-free sweeps of ochre and rust, as if pressed under weight. Across the upper third, a tight cluster of sharp, electric cadmium-yellow and white strokes moves in quick, staccato gestures that collide and fracture, creating high spatial tension. Between these zones, a pale, almost empty band of raw linen-colored canvas breathes, leaving room for restraint. Brushwork varies: thick impasto ridges where the paint was scraped and rebuilt, thin translucent glazes where colors bleed into each other, and a few drips that run downward and stop mid-canvas. Texture is uneven and tactile, with visible layering where earlier marks show through later ones. Rhythm comes from repeated arcs of gesture that loop and reverse direction, with contrast between the cool, controlled blues on the left and the warm, urgent reds on the right. The overall mood is charged and contained, dense in some places and open in others, with the color temperatures pulling against each other.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":471,"cache_read_input_tokens":15986,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":471},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b75bb140-25ea-